        <div class="about_text">
          <span class="about_kicker">About me</span>
          <h1>Design, creativity, and enthusiasm.</h1>

          <p class="about_text">I am Lucas Blas, a graphic designer with over 10 years of experience working on digital advertising projects, branding, social media, print design, and illustration for both local and international clients and brands.

Throughout my career I have worked in very diverse contexts: from print production and freelance projects to high-volume digital performance campaigns. This variety led me to develop a workflow that combines visual judgment, adaptability, and a focused eye on both detail and the strategic purpose behind every piece.

I am particularly interested in exploring new ways to create and optimize processes, seeking the right balance between creativity and results. In recent years, I integrated generative AI tools into my workflow to experiment, develop concepts, and expand design possibilities without losing the creative direction behind each decision.

I am currently continuing to expand my knowledge in design, technology, and visual communication, looking for projects that allow me to tackle new challenges and grow professionally.</p>

          <h2 style="background:var(--vino);padding-left:20px;border-radius:var(--radio);color:white">Tools & Skills</h2>
          <ul class="about_list">
            <li>Adobe Photoshop</li>
