            <li>Adobe Premiere Pro</li>
            <li>Figma</li>
            <li>Photo retouching & compositing</li>
            <li>Video editing & motion graphics</li>
            <li>Web & email design</li>
            <li>HTML & CSS fundamentals</li>
            <li>Generative AI & LLMs — ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini</li>
            <li>Visual generation with AI — Midjourney, ChatGPT, Grok</li>
          </ul>
          <h2 style="background:var(--vino);padding-left:20px;border-radius:var(--radio);color:white">Work Approach</h2>
          <ul class="about_list">
            <li>Creative direction & criteria</li>
