            <li>Leadership & teamwork</li>
            <li>Adaptability</li>
            <li>Organization & attention to detail</li>
            <li>Continuous learning</li>
          </ul>
          <p>If you made it this far, thank you for your time. You can contact me by <a href="index.html#contact" style="font-weight:bold;">clicking here</a> to be redirected to the contact section.</p>
